## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Kelly fractions negative (expected loss > win) | Clamp to 0, exclude class |
| Monte Carlo slow for many classes | 10K iterations default, configurable via --iterations |
| Existing calc engines have incompatible API | Read their actual function signatures in Phase 2 implementation; adapt wrapper if needed |
| ROI distributions unrealistic | P10-P90 range forces wide uncertainty; survivorship adjustment via failure_rate |
